{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "unitId": "chapter-when-moral-seriousness-scales-front-matter-introduction",
  "generationHash": "sha256:bdb26018fbcf469a672eeffe494efb70e1045ee63a2eea0fc9b9ea4d0e8cac3c",
  "granularity": "segment-only",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "s0001",
      "text": "Introduction",
      "startMs": 0.0,
      "endMs": 743.0,
      "charStart": 0,
      "charEnd": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "text": "The Scaling Question",
      "startMs": 1254.0,
      "endMs": 2461.0,
      "charStart": 14,
      "charEnd": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "text": "Moral seriousness does not disappear when systems grow.",
      "startMs": 3274.0,
      "endMs": 6734.0,
      "charStart": 36,
      "charEnd": 91
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "text": "But the conditions that support it change.",
      "startMs": 6734.0,
      "endMs": 9288.0,
      "charStart": 91,
      "charEnd": 133
    },
    {
      "id": "s0005",
      "text": "At small scale, restraint tends to be visible and reciprocated.",
      "startMs": 9462.0,
      "endMs": 13688.0,
      "charStart": 136,
      "charEnd": 199
    },
    {
      "id": "s0006",
      "text": "Harm lands somewhere specific.",
      "startMs": 13688.0,
      "endMs": 15755.0,
      "charStart": 199,
      "charEnd": 229
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "text": "Authority can be challenged without threatening the survival of the system itself.",
      "startMs": 15755.0,
      "endMs": 20283.0,
      "charStart": 229,
      "charEnd": 311
    },
    {
      "id": "s0008",
      "text": "Decisions and consequences remain close enough to one another that feedback corrects excess before it hardens.",
      "startMs": 20283.0,
      "endMs": 26947.0,
      "charStart": 311,
      "charEnd": 421
    },
    {
      "id": "s0009",
      "text": "Under these conditions, moral seriousness functions with relative stability.",
      "startMs": 26947.0,
      "endMs": 31812.0,
      "charStart": 421,
      "charEnd": 497
    },
    {
      "id": "s0010",
      "text": "Scale alters those conditions.",
      "startMs": 32706.0,
      "endMs": 34958.0,
      "charStart": 503,
      "charEnd": 533
    },
    {
      "id": "s0011",
      "text": "As systems expand, proximity diminishes.",
      "startMs": 35341.0,
      "endMs": 38313.0,
      "charStart": 535,
      "charEnd": 575
    },
    {
      "id": "s0012",
      "text": "Leaders make decisions that affect people they will never meet.",
      "startMs": 38313.0,
      "endMs": 41599.0,
      "charStart": 575,
      "charEnd": 638
    },
    {
      "id": "s0013",
      "text": "Consequences travel through layers of process before returning as data rather than experience.",
      "startMs": 41599.0,
      "endMs": 47462.0,
      "charStart": 638,
      "charEnd": 732
    },
    {
      "id": "s0014",
      "text": "Reciprocity becomes uneven.",
      "startMs": 47462.0,
      "endMs": 50457.0,
      "charStart": 732,
      "charEnd": 759
    },
    {
      "id": "s0015",
      "text": "Some actors remain exposed to consequence; others become insulated from it.",
      "startMs": 50457.0,
      "endMs": 55798.0,
      "charStart": 759,
      "charEnd": 834
    },
    {
      "id": "s0016",
      "text": "What once felt relational becomes administrative.",
      "startMs": 56970.0,
      "endMs": 59908.0,
      "charStart": 839,
      "charEnd": 888
    },
    {
      "id": "s0017",
      "text": "Distance does not eliminate responsibility.",
      "startMs": 60349.0,
      "endMs": 62880.0,
      "charStart": 890,
      "charEnd": 933
    },
    {
      "id": "s0018",
      "text": "It alters incentives.",
      "startMs": 63158.0,
      "endMs": 64714.0,
      "charStart": 934,
      "charEnd": 955
    },
    {
      "id": "s0019",
      "text": "When consequence becomes abstract, it can be displaced more easily.",
      "startMs": 64958.0,
      "endMs": 68998.0,
      "charStart": 957,
      "charEnd": 1024
    },
    {
      "id": "s0020",
      "text": "When reciprocity weakens, restraint becomes less self-reinforcing.",
      "startMs": 68998.0,
      "endMs": 73457.0,
      "charStart": 1024,
      "charEnd": 1090
    },
    {
      "id": "s0021",
      "text": "Actions that tolerate externalized cost often move faster than those that absorb it.",
      "startMs": 73457.0,
      "endMs": 78774.0,
      "charStart": 1090,
      "charEnd": 1174
    },
    {
      "id": "s0022",
      "text": "Under these conditions, moral seriousness may continue to guide individuals, but it no longer operates within the same structural equilibrium.",
      "startMs": 78774.0,
      "endMs": 87319.0,
      "charStart": 1174,
      "charEnd": 1316
    },
    {
      "id": "s0023",
      "text": "This book asks how moral seriousness functions under those altered",
      "startMs": 88236.0,
      "endMs": 91974.0,
      "charStart": 1321,
      "charEnd": 1387
    },
    {
      "id": "s0024",
      "text": "conditions.",
      "startMs": 92009.0,
      "endMs": 92752.0,
      "charStart": 1388,
      "charEnd": 1399
    },
    {
      "id": "s0025",
      "text": "It does not assume that scale corrupts.",
      "startMs": 93356.0,
      "endMs": 95469.0,
      "charStart": 1401,
      "charEnd": 1440
    },
    {
      "id": "s0026",
      "text": "It does not argue that escalation is inevitable.",
      "startMs": 95469.0,
      "endMs": 98430.0,
      "charStart": 1440,
      "charEnd": 1488
    },
    {
      "id": "s0027",
      "text": "It does not suggest that restraint is futile.",
      "startMs": 98697.0,
      "endMs": 101216.0,
      "charStart": 1490,
      "charEnd": 1535
    },
    {
      "id": "s0028",
      "text": "It examines how proximity, reciprocity, and visible consequence create moral density—and how that density thins as systems grow.",
      "startMs": 101216.0,
      "endMs": 110028.0,
      "charStart": 1535,
      "charEnd": 1663
    },
    {
      "id": "s0029",
      "text": "At small scale, authority remains contestable because dissent does not threaten systemic collapse.",
      "startMs": 110423.0,
      "endMs": 116170.0,
      "charStart": 1666,
      "charEnd": 1764
    },
    {
      "id": "s0030",
      "text": "At larger scale, contestation can feel destabilizing.",
      "startMs": 116170.0,
      "endMs": 119595.0,
      "charStart": 1764,
      "charEnd": 1817
    },
    {
      "id": "s0031",
      "text": "Pressure to consolidate, accelerate, or harden authority increases.",
      "startMs": 119595.0,
      "endMs": 123624.0,
      "charStart": 1817,
      "charEnd": 1884
    },
    {
      "id": "s0032",
      "text": "These pressures are not proof of moral failure.",
      "startMs": 124309.0,
      "endMs": 126723.0,
      "charStart": 1887,
      "charEnd": 1934
    },
    {
      "id": "s0033",
      "text": "They are structural responses to complexity and distance.",
      "startMs": 126723.0,
      "endMs": 130322.0,
      "charStart": 1934,
      "charEnd": 1991
    },
    {
      "id": "s0034",
      "text": "The question, then, is not whether moral seriousness is valid.",
      "startMs": 130566.0,
      "endMs": 133933.0,
      "charStart": 1994,
      "charEnd": 2056
    },
    {
      "id": "s0035",
      "text": "It is how it operates when proximity fades, asymmetry increases, and incentives shift.",
      "startMs": 133933.0,
      "endMs": 139471.0,
      "charStart": 2056,
      "charEnd": 2142
    },
    {
      "id": "s0036",
      "text": "Judgment does not become obsolete under scale.",
      "startMs": 139970.0,
      "endMs": 142408.0,
      "charStart": 2145,
      "charEnd": 2191
    },
    {
      "id": "s0037",
      "text": "It becomes more costly.",
      "startMs": 142582.0,
      "endMs": 143952.0,
      "charStart": 2192,
      "charEnd": 2215
    },
    {
      "id": "s0038",
      "text": "It becomes more difficult to absorb harm when harm can be hidden.",
      "startMs": 144277.0,
      "endMs": 147969.0,
      "charStart": 2217,
      "charEnd": 2282
    },
    {
      "id": "s0039",
      "text": "It becomes more difficult to preserve contestability when dissent threatens stability.",
      "startMs": 147969.0,
      "endMs": 152822.0,
      "charStart": 2282,
      "charEnd": 2368
    },
    {
      "id": "s0040",
      "text": "It becomes more difficult to move slowly when others move quickly under reduced constraint.",
      "startMs": 152822.0,
      "endMs": 157548.0,
      "charStart": 2368,
      "charEnd": 2459
    },
    {
      "id": "s0041",
      "text": "These pressures do not determine outcomes.",
      "startMs": 158163.0,
      "endMs": 160625.0,
      "charStart": 2463,
      "charEnd": 2505
    },
    {
      "id": "s0042",
      "text": "But they shape the terrain on which decisions are made.",
      "startMs": 160625.0,
      "endMs": 163457.0,
      "charStart": 2505,
      "charEnd": 2560
    },
    {
      "id": "s0043",
      "text": "Understanding that terrain is the purpose of this book.",
      "startMs": 163724.0,
      "endMs": 166813.0,
      "charStart": 2563,
      "charEnd": 2618
    }
  ]
}
